+  - experiment_id: exp5105-fr11-severa-guarded-memory-v468
+    verdict: complete_fr11_severa_guarded_memory_no_promote_contracts_working_delta_plus_0p000
+    addressed_by: "The mechanism changes from generic guarded memory to contextual case selection with regret/coverage telemetry and solver-action advantages."
+    retire_if_same_verdict: true
+  prompt: |
+    CONTEXT:
+    This is the required continuous self-learning task for .470. It must not use the blocked FoVer residual path. Use exact-solver traces from exp5130 and evaluate no-weight deployment-time learning: select reusable cases, estimate action/heuristic advantages, apply only guarded policy hints, and roll back unless held-out utility and nonforgetting are safe.
+
+    EXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:
+    - CLAUDE.md
+    - research-program.md
+    - results/experiment_5130_taco_sampler_heldout_scale_v470.json
+    - results/experiment_5105_fr11_severa_guarded_memory_v468.json
