+    - openspec/capabilities/autoresearch/spec.md
+
+    TASK:
+    Build and evaluate a CASCADE/JitRL-style no-weight case policy over exact-solver traces. The policy may select cases or heuristic hints, but the exact solver remains the correctness authority.
+
+    CONCRETE STEPS:
+    1. Hard-block if exp5130 heldout_csp_trace_suite_ready is not true.
+    2. Split traces chronologically or by instance family into learning, validation, and held-out sets.
+    3. Implement a nonparametric case policy with contextual selection, TTL/decay, and action/heuristic advantage estimates.
+    4. Compare no-learning, naive retrieval, case-policy, and case-policy-with-harm-gate arms.
+    5. Measure heldout_delta, nonforgetting_delta, harmful_promotion_count, regret/coverage telemetry, and exact-solver correctness.
